// ============================================================================
//  Nulled - "Through the Null" transit script
//
//  Dive into the Null black hole and come out of Earth's Moon, back home.
//
//  SpaceEngine has no built-in portals, so this script plays the transit:
//    1. flies you into Null's event horizon
//    2. drops you onto the Moon's surface
//    3. lifts you off the Moon so Earth rises in front of you
//
//  Run it from SpaceEngine's script menu or console (see README.md).
// ============================================================================

Print "Approaching Null..." { Time 4 }
Select "Null"
Goto { Time 6 DistRad 40 }
Wait 6

Print "Crossing the event horizon" { Time 3 }
Goto { Time 4 DistRad 1.0 }
Wait 4.2

// --- the other side -------------------------------------------------------
Select "Moon"
Goto { Time 0 DistRad 1.002 }      // instant: you emerge just above the lunar surface
Wait 1

Print "...you come out of the Moon." { Time 5 }
Goto { Time 6 DistRad 3 }          // rise away from the Moon
Wait 6

Select "Earth"
Goto { Time 10 DistRad 4 }         // and fly home to Earth
Wait 10
Print "Welcome back to Earth." { Time 5 }
